    "text": "Consider the following cell reaction&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cd</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Hg</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>(</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>&#8652;</mo><msub><mi>CdSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>Hg</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math><br />The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi>cell</mi><mn>0</mn></msubsup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>315</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>825</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;the standard entropy change <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;S</mi><mo>&#176;</mo></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is _________ . (Nearest integer)<br />[Given : Faraday constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>96487</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>]"
  },
